    {
      "id": 117832,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Users can participate in OpenChat using a new OpenChat profile that is distinct from the LINE profile. However, when the victim attaches an image in a post in OpenChat's Note, the ID of LINE Profile was stored together in the image's metadata. From this information, it is possible to determine the LINE user profile of OpenChat participants.",
